OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,A'It's been relentless' say IT workers
OL,4,Aon frontline of PHP cyber-security
OL,5,Ascramble
OL,6,
OL,7,FMicrosoft boss Satya Nadella says he
OL,8,Fhas not seen anything like the PHP
OL,9,Femergency "in a long, long time".
OL,11,FReferencing the ongoing global efforts
OL,12,Fto fix the critical cyber-security flaw
OL,13,Fin millions of websites, he told a
OL,14,Fconference "it was a long day and a
OL,15,Flong night, I know, for all the IT and
OL,16,Fsecurity folks".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
