CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1792784893
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,A'It's been relentless' say IT workers
OL,4,Aon frontline of PHP cyber-security
OL,5,Ascramble
OL,6,
OL,7,FOther IT and cyber experts have told
OL,8,Fthe BBC about their struggles in the
OL,9,Flast 48 hours, whose stories give us an
OL,10,Finsight into what it is like at the
OL,11,Fcoalface of a major cyber emergency.
OL,12,FBut also highlight how misinformation
OL,13,Fand panic has made things a lot worse.
OL,15,F"It's been relentless," says UK-based
OL,16,Fsystem administrator Adam Mudd.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
