OL,3,AThe Indian workers filming their work
OL,4,Ato train AI
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The routine is simple, but you have to
OL,7,Fbe disciplined about how you move. The
OL,8,Foperations team taught me that my hands
OL,9,Falways have to stay cleanly inside the
OL,10,Fframe, the lighting has to be sharp,
OL,11,Fand I can't tilt my head too abruptly
OL,12,Fwhile working."
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
