OL,3,ABabydoll singer gives Wales its first
OL,4,AUK number one in 15 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FJamie Miller has become the first Welsh
OL,7,Fartist to top the UK singles chart in
OL,8,F15 years with his viral TikTok hit,
OL,9,FBabydoll.
OL,11,FMiller, who is originally from
OL,12,FPontprennau in Cardiff, narrowly beat
OL,13,FTate McRae and her single Housewife to
OL,14,Fclaim the top spot on the UK Number 1
OL,15,Fon Friday, according to the Official
OL,16,FCharts Company.
OL,18,FThe achievement means Miller is the
OL,19,Ffirst Welsh artist since 2011 to earn a
OL,20,FUK Number 1 single - after Sian Evans'
OL,21,Ffeature on DJ Fresh's Louder.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
