OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABabydoll singer gives Wales its first
OL,4,AUK number one in 15 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiller, 29, told Charts: "I don't even
OL,7,Fknow what to say other than thank you
OL,8,Fso much for getting me Number 1, this
OL,9,Fis the biggest thing that's ever
OL,10,Fhappened to me in my life, I love you
OL,11,Fguys."
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
