OL,3,AFinal James Bond screen tests to take
OL,4,Aplace this weekend, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeadline reported the screen tests had
OL,7,Fbeen due take place in early October,
OL,8,Fbut had been delayed by scheduling
OL,9,Fconflicts, while Variety said Turner
OL,10,Fand Lowden "appear to be in the mix" to
OL,11,Freplace Daniel Craig.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
