OL,11,G2055 This Week in History
OL,12,     FThe United Nations is officially
OL,13,     Festablished, King Charles I beat
OL,14,     FEnglish parliamentarian forces at
OL,15,     Fthe Battle of Edgehill, and the
OL,16,     F'Lady Chatterley's Lover' trial
OL,17,     Fopens.
